{"id": 1169, "name": "Lauder Family Campground", "read": "2026-10-16", "pages": [{"url": "https://lauderfamilycampground.com/", "lines": ["oms with hot showers. A picnic table and firepit is at each site. | RV Rentals | We have 2 RV's for rent-- 2019 Wolf pup which is good for 2 adults and 2 children--it is small with 1 slide. Queen bed and jackknife sofa. $140/night | 2022 Toy Hauler (no slides) with a queen bedroom and a set of queen bunks in the open area. Suitable for 4 adults or 2 adults and 2-3 children. $150/night NO PETS IN EITHER CAMPER | Laude", "ldren--it is small with 1 slide. Queen bed and jackknife sofa. $140/night | 2022 Toy Hauler (no slides) with a queen bedroom and a set of queen bunks in the open area. Suitable for 4 adults or 2 adults and 2-3 children. $150/night NO PETS IN EITHER CAMPER | Lauder Family Campground Map | Welcome friends old and new | At Lauder Family Campground, we believe the best way to reconnect with friends and family is to unplu", ", we believe the best way to reconnect with friends and family is to unplug and relax. We hope you can do that when you visit us here. Come fish, hike, bike and just view the beauty of our forest. | Guesthouse Apartment $135 per night (no pets) price based on 4 adults. Discount for 5 or more nights | | | | | | | | | | | | | Guesthouse Apartment entrance | Photo Gallery of cabins, ponds, tents | | | | | | | | | | | | ", "Glamping Tent | PRICES | Cabin 1, 3, & Glamping Tents (no running water in small cabins or tents) | prices for 4 adults 2 night minimum, 3 night minimum on Holiday Weekends. Small cabins and the large Glamping tents are $75 per night and have a mini split for heat and cooling. The Small Glamping tent in the upper yard is $65/night based on 2 adult guests and has no heat or air conditioning. You can add a portable air", "t for heat and cooling. The Small Glamping tent in the upper yard is $65/night based on 2 adult guests and has no heat or air conditioning. You can add a portable air conditioner or small heater for an additional fee of $10 per night. | starting at $65/night | Suitable for 2-4 Adults--max 6 Adults | $10 per person per night after 4 Adults | Bathhouse is open with 2 ADA approved full bathrooms | Big Log Cabin ( Has fl", "t. | starting at $65/night | Suitable for 2-4 Adults--max 6 Adults | $10 per person per night after 4 Adults | Bathhouse is open with 2 ADA approved full bathrooms | Big Log Cabin ( Has flush toilet and sink on porch) | $135/night and $125 per night for 5 or more nights Suitable for 4 adults. Maximum 8 adults. $10 extra for each adult over 4. There are 2 RV sites that are in front of the cabin that can be rented with", "on porch) | $135/night and $125 per night for 5 or more nights Suitable for 4 adults. Maximum 8 adults. $10 extra for each adult over 4. There are 2 RV sites that are in front of the cabin that can be rented with it for $45 per night. No pets allowed in cabin. One site is full hook up and the other is 30 or 50 amp electric only. | Electric RV Campsites | RV site rates include Filling and Dumping for free. All sites h", " Electric RV Campsites | RV site rates include Filling and Dumping for free. All sites have fire pits with a cooking grate and a picnic table. Site A, B, C, and G are full hook up sites. | 30 and 50 amp electric are all $45/night and full hook up are $55/night | All rates based on 4 Adults per site. Additional adults an extra fee of $10/night. If you have 2 tents on a site and 2 families, it's the regular rate plus t", "Additional adults an extra fee of $10/night. If you have 2 tents on a site and 2 families, it's the regular rate plus the add a tent rates. | Add a tent | If another family wants to add a tent to any site it is an extra $10pp/night for over 12 years old. | Organized Group Tenting | Large groups of 20 or more can call ahead to book and use the lower primitive area or the upper yard area and use a pavilion based on ava", "nting | Large groups of 20 or more can call ahead to book and use the lower primitive area or the upper yard area and use a pavilion based on availability. call for specifics and pricing. | All Primitive tent camping is $15 per person/night | This is for campers staying in a primitive area without electric and includes use of shower and fire pit, or for Group campers in the primitive area for multiple nights (and inc", "pit that can be used. Plenty of plugs for crock pots. Rental includes use of pavilion for the day from noon till 8 pm. There is a volleyball court, horseshoes and cornhole that can be used. Call for pricing. Starting at $125/day. | We have bundles of firewood for sale for $15 for a wheelbarrow load and IBC | Private Port-a-potty | We have 2 port-a-potties we can rent for your site, tent, or cabin for $25 for your sta", "used. Call for pricing. Starting at $125/day. | We have bundles of firewood for sale for $15 for a wheelbarrow load and IBC | Private Port-a-potty | We have 2 port-a-potties we can rent for your site, tent, or cabin for $25 for your stay. They will be freshly cleaned with toilet paper. | Maximum 4 adults per site- Must be 21 years old to reserve | Campground Rules | CHECK IN 3 pm CHECK out 12 noon. | Early arrivals a", " Fishing hours are restricted to dawn to dusk. | All children under the age of 16 must be fully supervised when fishing or playing near the ponds. | If you have guests at the campground and they want to fish, there is a $5.00 per day fee per person for the privilege of fishing. | CATCH AND RELEASE ONLY--PLEASE USE BARBLESS HOOKS OR BEND YOUR BARBS | These rules are for the protection and benefit of all campers, and w"]}, {"url": "https://www.hipcamp.com/en-US/land/pennsylvania-lauder-family-campground-5x5hkyk2", "lines": ["ng area and a fold out sofa. Large game room in the basement with ping pong and pool table. Access to all fishing etc in the campground. Fire pit and picnic table outside. Near the play area and upper pond. 4 adults and $10 per person over 4. C